desc: Surround each word with quotes
category: ex
par: 11
hint1: Macros or substitution?
hint2: In :s replacement, & refers to the entire match — .* grabs the whole line
solution: :%s/.*/"&"<CR>
note: .* matches the whole line; & in the replacement re-inserts it, wrapped in quotes.
--- START ---
apple
banana
cherry
date
elderberry
--- GOAL ---
"apple"
"banana"
"cherry"
"date"
"elderberry"
--- END ---
